      "finding": "R1-F1",
      "reason": "The check warning rested on an unverified mechanism. The harness layout is not installed under the project, so check cannot translate the files. The requirement and its criterion are removed; staleness is seen in the preview."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-28T16:44:25Z",
      "choice": "applied",
      "earlier": [],
      "finding": "R1-F2",
      "reason": "Recovery could not work with the old state rules. Added an applied state tried first, so a replaced or created file that equals its staged hash is left alone and only the manifest is written; added the unrecorded state."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-28T16:44:25Z",
      "choice": "applied",
      "earlier": [],
      "finding": "R1-F3",
      "reason": "The no-write promise was too strong. It now covers a re-read of every file and a digest rebuild before the first write; a change afterwards stops with exit 3 and is finished by a second run. No rollback is promised."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-28T16:48:17Z",
      "choice": "applied",
      "earlier": [],
      "finding": "R2-F1",
      "reason": "An owner-added allow rule would have made the permissions file read as edited and refused the whole refresh. The file is now explicitly outside the state table and keeps the rerender rules: carried allow rules, shown in the preview, the resulting hash recorded."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-28T16:50:04Z",
      "choice": "applied",
      "earlier": [],
      "finding": "R3-F1",
      "reason": "The missing and orphaned rows overlapped. Orphaned is now tested before every other row, and missing means a path that is still staged."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-28T16:50:04Z",
      "choice": "applied",
      "earlier": [],
      "finding": "R3-F2",
      "reason": "A linked file with matching content could have been classed current. Every staged and listed path is now read without following links first, and a link is refused even when nothing else would change."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-28T16:50:04Z",
      "choice": "applied",
      "earlier": [],
      "finding": "R3-F3",
      "reason": "The hash-pair requirement could not hold for new and orphaned files. The criterion now shows none for a hash that does not exist."
    }
